[en.FOCUS_C04_NEW_EMPLOYEE]
Cheap Labor

[en.FOCUS_C04_NEW_EMPLOYEE_desc]
... and so, Short Fuse inexplicably became the new cheap labor of the new Stratusburg diner... Except for Short Fuse himself, it seems that all the other ponies in the diner know about it... But... what will happen on payday?\n\nAnyway, the new friends who have left the "Eliminators" and joined Stratusburg need to be educated in friendship! Sky Stinger took on this responsibility, hoping to train Short Fuse into a true Harmonist in a few months!

[zh.FOCUS_C04_NEW_EMPLOYEE]
廉价劳动力

[zh.FOCUS_C04_NEW_EMPLOYEE_desc]
... 于是，火药桶不明不白地成为了层云堡新餐馆的新廉价劳动力... 这件事除了火药桶自己，似乎餐馆中的其他小马都知道了... 只是... 等到发工资的那天怎么办呢？\n\n总之，脱离“淘汰者”加入层云堡的新朋友，要做好友谊教育啊！破空肩负起了这个责任，期望在几个月内将火药桶培养成一个真正的谐律主义者！

